reports/theme-audit-interaction.md
reports/theme-audit/
reports/*-release-gate/

# husky runtime shim files (generated by `pnpm install`)
.husky/_

# visual review runtime artifacts (PNG bytes vary across sharp builds)
reports/*-visual-review/
